		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Slender, bat-winged black demonkin whose loose skin dangles in ropey strands. Slavers and kidnappers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +7 (1d10) and entangle (near), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Entangle</strong>. One creature within near, DEX 15+ or entangled in skin-strands. STR 15+ on turn to break free. AC 15. 4+ damage to sever.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources. Weapons dissolve if slain.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
